[2026-03-14T19:20:49.025Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013GfvP6vtct8w76je2MdhnU","type":"tool_result","content":"497:- **Expected:** The app calls `POST /api/bookings` with the property_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, and total_price. A success message is displayed (e.g., \"Booking confirmed!\") and the user is redirected to the My Trips page (`/trips`), or a confirmation is shown on the same page.\n600:## Page: My Trips (`/trips`)\n602:<!-- Components: TripsTabs, TripCard, CancelBookingDialog -->\n604:### Component: TripsTabs\n606:#### Test: My Trips page requires login\n609:- **Expected:** The user is redirected to the login page (`/login`). The My Trips page content is not displayed.\n611:#### Test: My Trips page defaults to Upcoming tab\n621:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page with the \"Upcoming\" tab selected. The user has completed bookings.\n626:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page with the \"Upcoming\" tab selected. The user has cancelled bookings.\n631:- **Initial state:** User is on the My Trips page with the \"Past\" tab selected.\n651:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page.\n655:### Component: TripCard\n658:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page. A booking exists for property \"Beach House\" in \"Malibu\" with check_in \"2026-05-01\", check_out \"2026-05-05\", status \"confirmed\", and total_price $800. The property has an image.\n662:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page. Bookings exist with different statuses.\n666:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page. One booking has a property with images, another has a property with no images.\n670:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page. A trip card is displayed for a booking with id \"booking-123\".\n711:### Component: CancelBookingDialog\n1258:- **Expected:** The page displays a message such as \"You have already reviewed this booking\" and does not show the review form. Optionally shows a link back to My Trips.\n1329:- **Expected:** The review is submitted successfully via `POST /api/reviews`. The app navigates back to `/trips` (My Trips page). A success notification or message such as \"Review submitted successfully\" appears.\n1355:#### Test: Write Review button on My Trips disappears after submitting review\n1356:- **Initial state:** User has a completed booking for \"Oceanfront Villa\" showing a \"Write Review\" button on the My Trips page.\n1373:- **Expected:** The page displays a message such as \"You have already reviewed this booking\" instead of the review form. A link to return to My Trips is available."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HL6AgLGdMnMPrnE15ohh6U","session_id":"4df6dc85-d756-49bf-87d9-904605d680a8","uuid":"0a0e2ec6-4560-4dc5-a74f-c4c4172acdcd"}
